{"availability":"available","full":"winterop-com/dirigent-dhis2","name":"dirigent-dhis2","description":"The DHIS2 adapter pack for dirigent: a connection kind and the blocks for one DHIS2 instance.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-08T20:42:46Z","updated":"2026-10-07T12:41:18Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://winterop-com.github.io/dirigent-dhis2/","topics":["dhis2","dirigent","python"],"demo":"https://winterop-com.github.io/dirigent-dhis2/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T13:35:41.568Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T13:35:41.568Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T13:35:41.568Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T11:15:38.369Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:19:21.802Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T13:35:41.568Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Documentation: . New to dirigent and DHIS2 together? The tutorial is one read, one schema gate and one rehearsed write against the public play demo, end to end.","The DHIS2 adapter pack for dirigent. It contributes the dhis2 connection kind, three JSON Schema formats (dhis2-uid, dhis2-period and dhis2-code), and the blocks that speak DHIS2's asynchronous jobs, import summaries, completeness registrations, metadata, tracker and analytics reads as first-class steps, rather than composing them out of raw HTTP:","Where a block takes DHIS2's own query terms, either shape does: fields, filter and order each accept one string, spelled as the API spells it -- id,name,valueType, level:eq:2, name:asc -- or a list, which the pack comma-joins or repeats as the resource wants."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/winterop-com/dirigent-dhis2/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c19f0f190c9fda89e1141e15ceafbaa2b53bce92d7238bbf6c06c501336599ce","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:38.490Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:07:39.114Z","projectInsights":{"version"